{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":3000,"row":{"en":"I'm excited to see what the future holds.","wo":"Yàkkamti naa xam luma Yàlla dencal ëlëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYakhanti na kham louma yalla deuncal euleuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3001,"row":{"en":"Man requests sword fight with ex-wife and lawyer to settle legal dispute.","wo":"Ku goor ki defa laaj xeexe epe ak soxnan bawon ak awokam ngir lijanti seeni xëccoo bu nekkon ci yoonu atte.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor ki dafa ladj khekhé eupé ak sokhna bawone ak awokam nguir lidieunti séni khethio bou nékone thi yonou atté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3002,"row":{"en":"Once they arrive, our urgent plumber will diagnose the issue and rapidly repair the leak or burst pipe.","wo":"Bi ñu yegsee, sunu plombier bi dina gaaw defar fiy senn wala tuyo bi toj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnou yégssé souniou plombier bi dina gaw defar fiy sène wala tuyo bi todj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3003,"row":{"en":"There are many organizations that work to prevent and stop animal cruelty, but more needs to be done.","wo":"Barina kuréel yuy xeex lii di def yëfi soxor baayima yi, waaye liggéey bi des na lu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina koureul youy khekh lii di def yeufi sohor bayima yi wayé liguey bi dess na lou bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3004,"row":{"en":"If you have any questions about this ban, please do not hesitate to contact us.","wo":"Su ngeen laaj bu jël ci wàllu dàq, jokkoo leen ak nun.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou ngéne ladj bou dieul thi wallou daq diokho léne ak nioune.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3005,"row":{"en":"That is true, said the dancer. But the challenge is part of what makes them so rewarding.","wo":"Fecckat bi tontu ko ni, Lolu dëgg la, mu dellu ni Waaye coono bi ngay daj ngir mën ko jarna ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFeuthieukat bi tontou ko ni, lolou deug la, mou dellou ni wayé thiono bi ngay dadj nguir meun ko diarna ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3006,"row":{"en":"But they still love you and enjoy your company.","wo":"Waaye du tere dañu lay bëgg, bëgg di nekk sa wet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé dou téré daniou lay beug, beug di nekk sa weté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3007,"row":{"en":"Two happy young girls laughing, drinking beer, and eating pizza at a home party late.","wo":"Ñaari xale yu jigeen ñungi reetaan, di naan sangara, di lekk pizza ci ab fo bu yagg ci biir kër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnaari khalé you djiguéne gnongui réétane di nane sangara di leke pizza si ab foo bou yague si biir keur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3008,"row":{"en":"We can see light because it enters our eyes and stimulates the retina, which is a light-sensitive tissue at the back of the eye.","wo":"Li tax nuy mëna gis leer mooy dafay dugg sunuy bët daal di cuq retine bi, muy tisu buy gis leer nekk ci ginaaw bët bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi takh niouy meuna guiss leer moy dafay dougg souniouy beut daldi thiouk retine bi, mouy tissu bouy guiss leer nekk thi guinaw beut bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3009,"row":{"en":"Small round white side table with a lamp beside a cup of tea and coffee, plant standing on top, modern furniture.","wo":"Jenn table ju ndaw ju weex te rond bu amaale benn làmp ci wet gi, benn kaasu kafe wala ataaya, teg garab gu ndaw ci kawam, mëbal modern.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJenn table djou ndaw djou wekh té rond bou amalé benn làmp thi wet gui, benn kaassou café wala ataaya, teugg garab gou ndaw thi kawam, meubal moderne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3010,"row":{"en":"I was relieved to hear that I didn't have Lyme disease, but I was still a little bit concerned about the rash.","wo":"Bi ñu ma waxee ni amu ma feebaru Lyme ci laa féex, waaye tëndandiir yi ci sama yaram jaaxal nañu ma ba leegi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnou ma wakhee ni amouma fébarou lyme thi la fékh wayé teundandiir yi thi sama yaram diakhal nagnou ma ba légui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3011,"row":{"en":"You must learn to use your power to heal the world, not to harm it.","wo":"Danga jàng jëfandikoo sa kàttan ngir defar àdduna te bañ ko lor.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanga diang dieufandiko sa katane nguir defar addouna té bagne ko loré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3012,"row":{"en":"Governments have been using laws to restrict the media, and journalists have been harassed and attacked.","wo":"Nguur yi dañuy tëral ay loi yuy tënk mejaa yi, ba noppi ñuy sonal taskati xibaar, di dal seen kaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNguur yi daniouy teureul ay loi youy teunk média yi ba noppi gnouy sonal taskati khibaar di dal sen kaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3013,"row":{"en":"as long as","wo":"lu mu tuuti tuuti","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nloumou touti touti\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3014,"row":{"en":"Nationalism has taken hold in many countries, and people are more divided than ever.","wo":"Nationalism dugg na ci réew yu bari, nangu leen, tax nit ñi di gëna xaajaloo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNationalisme dougg na si rew you bari nangou len takh nitt gni di geuna khadjalo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3015,"row":{"en":"I'm trying to sell matches, the little girl said. But no one will buy them.","wo":"Xale bu jigéen bi tontu ko, damay jaay alumet waaye kenn jëndul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé bou djiguéne bi tontou ko, damay diay alumét wayé kene dieundoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3016,"row":{"en":"Fufu is a starchy, doughy food made from pounded plantains or cassava.","wo":"Fufu feculent la, di ñamu pat bu ñuy defaree ñàmbi wala plantain buñ dëbb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFoufou feculent la di gniamou pate bou gnouy defaré gnambi wala plantain bouniou deub.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3017,"row":{"en":"It is often caused by autoimmune diseases, such as rheumatoid arthritis and Crohn’s disease.","wo":"Li koy faral di indi mooy feebar yuy imunise seen bopp, lu ci melni rheumatoid arthritis ak feebaru Crohn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi koy faral di indi moy fébar youy immunisé sén bopp, lou thi melni rheumatoid arthritis ak fébarou Crohn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3018,"row":{"en":"It was a perfect day.","wo":"Bis bu neex la woon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiss bou nekh la wone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3019,"row":{"en":"General hospitals provide a wide range of services, including medical, surgical, obstetrical, and pediatric care.","wo":"Hopitaal general yi dañu def xeetu paj yu bari yu ci melni medsin, operaasioŋ, wàllu am doom, ak pajum xale.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHopital general yi daniou def khettou padj you bari you thi melni medsin, operation, wallou ame dome, ak padjoum khalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3020,"row":{"en":"The novel transforms into something completely different the moment the princess leaves the castle.","wo":"Téeré bi dey soppi ci benen anam yu wutté waxtu bi doomi buur bu jigeen bi di jogé ci kër buur ba.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTéré bi dey sopi si benene anam you wouté wakhtou bi domi bour bou djiguéne bi di diogué si keur bour ba.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3021,"row":{"en":"Eventually, Constance decides to give Frederick a chance.","wo":"Ginaaw ga, Constance nangu nekk ak Frederick.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw ga constance nangou nekk ak frédérick.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3022,"row":{"en":"It is vital that the resident be aware of the specific bed reservation policy of their sponsoring agency, if any.","wo":"Defa doon lu baax dëkk kat bi xam nakalay laaje ñu bayyilko ay lall ci asans bikoy parene.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDéfa done lou bakh deuk kat bi kham nakalay ladjé gnou bayilko ay lall thi asans bikoy paréné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3023,"row":{"en":"Sets were moved, lighting was adjusted, and actors made costume changes.","wo":"Dekoor buñ toxal, leeral buñ yamale aktër yuy soppi kostum yiñ sol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDécor bougnou tokhal léral bougnou yamalé acteur youy sopi costume yignou sol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3024,"row":{"en":"And if that something is a king or a queen, then so be it.","wo":"Ba noppi su amee lu nekk buur wala lingeer, kon nekk na ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa noppi sou amé lou nekk bour wala lingéér kone nekk nako.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3025,"row":{"en":"Mother: It is, but it's also full of amazing things.","wo":"Yaay ji: Dafa yaatu kay, waaye noonu la baree mbir yu yéeme.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji dafa yatou kay wayé nonou la baré mbir you yémé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3026,"row":{"en":"When she got home from school, he gave her the CD and told her to listen to it.","wo":"Bimu wàccee ekol, mu daal di koy jox CD bi niko mu déglu ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBimou wathie école, mou daldi koy diokh CD bi niko mou deglou ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3027,"row":{"en":"One reason is that water scarcity is a growing problem around the world.","wo":"Benn ci sabab yooyu mooy ñàkkum ndox maa ngi jur jafe-jafe yu mag ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi sabab yoyou moye gnakoum ndokh mangui diour diafé diafé you mag thi addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3028,"row":{"en":"You have been given a clear and concise warning.","wo":"Àrtu nañu la bu baax, te leer na ci sa bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nArtou nagnou la bou bakh té leer na thi sa boppé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3029,"row":{"en":"As you relax, imagine yourself in a beautiful place.","wo":"Sa yaram a ngi bàyyeeku, leegi yóbbul sa xel ci barab bu rafet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSa yaram a ngui bayéko, légui yoboul sa hel thi barab bou raféte.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3030,"row":{"en":"One of the students, named Christian, is the best player on the team.","wo":"Kenn ci ndongo yi, ku tuddu Christian, mooy joueur bi gëna aay ci ekip bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKenn thi ndongo yi kou toudou Christian moy joueur bi geuna aye thi ekip bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3031,"row":{"en":"Shop locally and enjoy world-class bicycle brands' bike frames (consult the manual)!","wo":"Jëndeel ci dëkk bi nga am kadre welo yu màrk yu siiw ci àdduna (xoolal téere bi)!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJeundeul si deuk bi nga ame cadre welo you mark you siiw si addouna (kholal tééré bi)!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3032,"row":{"en":"They are fully transferable, just like physical tickets printed on ticket stock.","wo":"Ñoom ñépp mën nañu leen toxal, ñoom ak biye physique yiñ imprime ci këyit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnom gneup meun nagnou lén tokhal, gnom ak bié physique yign imprimer si keuyit.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3033,"row":{"en":"She looks around cautiously, as if she is afraid of being caught.","wo":"Mu geestu fu nekk, melni ku doon ragal ñu jàpp ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui guestou fou nek melni kou done ragal gnou diap ko\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3034,"row":{"en":"Freedom of the press is essential for a healthy democracy.","wo":"Ngir demokraasi mëna dundu, fàww nit ñi am sañ-sañu joxe xibaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgir démocrasi meuna doundou faw nit gni ame sagn sagnou diokhé khibaar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3035,"row":{"en":"Madam, your glasses are fogged up!","wo":"Madam sa weer yi dañu ñaq!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMadam sa weer yi daniou gnak !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3036,"row":{"en":"There is a secondary element at work, an old defense mechanism.","wo":"Amna ñaareelu mbir mu ñuy liggéey, jumtukaayu kaaraange gu yàgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna gnarelou mbir mou gnuy liguey djumtoukayou kaarangé gou yague.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3037,"row":{"en":"Wait, the woman called I can see that you've put a lot of effort into this. Why don't you take a seat over there and I'll see what I can do.","wo":"Muni ma, Xaaral, gis naa ni daj nga ci coono bu bari. Demal nga toog fee ma xool lan laa mëna def ngir jàppale la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMouni ma kharal guiss na ni dadj nga si thiono bou bari. Demal nga togue fé ma khol lane la meuna def nguir diapalé la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3038,"row":{"en":"And because the vendors are independent businesses, they're often willing to negotiate prices.","wo":"Te ginaaw jaaykat yi seen bopp lañuy liggéey, dañuy nangu waxaale njëg yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTe guinaw djaykat yi sen bopp lagnouy liguey, dagnouy nangu wakhalé ndieuk yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3039,"row":{"en":"She's the Man is a film that is both funny and inspiring.","wo":"She's the Man filmu bu xoromu la, di yeete itam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nShe's the Man film bou khorom la di yeuté itam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3040,"row":{"en":"The pace of life was slow and relaxed, and there was always time to stop and chat with a neighbor.","wo":"Nit ñi di dundu ci seen teeyu bakkan, ku nekk am yittey taxam nuyu sa dëkkandoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gni di doundou si seen teuyou bakane, kou nek ame yitéy takham nouyou sa deukando.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3041,"row":{"en":"New Study Finds That Breast Cancer Screenings Can Lead to False Positives","wo":"Jàngat bu Bees Wane ni Radio Cancer u Ween Mën na Juum ni Am nga ko Fekk Amoo ko","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJangat bou bess wané ni radio cancer ou ween meun na djoum ni am nga ko fek amo ko\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3042,"row":{"en":"seriously","wo":"ci anam bu dëggu","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nthi anam bou deugu\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3043,"row":{"en":"Acid rain can also kill fish and other aquatic life by making the water too acidic.","wo":"Tawu asid mën na ray jën yi ak leneen luy dund ci ndox ndax dafay asidloo ndox mi lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTawou acide meun na ray dieun yi ak lénéne louy dounde si ndokh ndakh dafay asidloo ndokh mi lool.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3044,"row":{"en":"Find a lunch partner, a dinner mate, and engage in casual or intimate chat.","wo":"Wut kooy bokkal añ wala kooy bokkal reer, ngeen séq waxtaan yu neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWout kouy bokale agne wala kouy bokale rére, ngéne sék wakhtane you nékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3045,"row":{"en":"Therapist: So, you're here because you're having some conflict with your roommate.","wo":"Terapist bi: Ngani danga am jafe-jafe ak ki nga nekkal moo tax nga ñëw fi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTerapist bi né ngani danga ame diafé diafé ak ki nga nekal mo takh nga nieuw fi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3046,"row":{"en":"Benefit from our continuous innovation and scientific expertise.","wo":"Njariñ li ci sunu gis-gis yu bees ak sunu xam-xam bu lalu ci science.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdiariigne li thi souniou guiss-guiss you bess ak souniou kham-kham bou lalou thi science bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3047,"row":{"en":"Of course, no discussion of open-air markets would be complete without mentioning the food.","wo":"Dëgg la, kenn mënul wax ci marse luuma te doo wax ci lekk yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeug la kene meunoul wakh si marché louma té do wakh si lekk yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3048,"row":{"en":"Brown leather flight jacket with fur neck lining, dark gray tank top, dog tags, black belt, and torn dark gray jeans.","wo":"Vestu vol bu der bu sokolaa am fourure bu double ci baat bi, debardër bu dóomu taal bu lëndëm, etiketu xaj, sentiir bu ñuul ak jean bu dóomu taal bu lëndëm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nVestou vol bou deure bou sokola am fourure bou double thi baat bi, debardeur bou domou taal bou leundeum, etikétou khadj, sentir bou nioul ak jean bou domou taal bou leundeum.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3049,"row":{"en":"The tick was attached to me for 24 hours and I developed a large rash afterwards.","wo":"Xuribi nekk na ci man ci diru 24 waxtu te ci ganaw lolou ma am ay tupu-tupu yu bëri.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhouribi nekk na thie mane thie dirou 24 wahtou té thie ganaw lolou ma ame ay toupou-toupou you beuri.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3050,"row":{"en":"Light and darkness are two opposites, but they're also two sides of the same coin.","wo":"Leer ak lëndëm ñaari mbir yu wuute lañu, waaye itam dañu melni ñaari wetu benn piyeesu xaalis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLér ak leundeum gnari mbir you wouté lagnou wayé itam daniou melni gnari wetou bene piéssou khalis.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3051,"row":{"en":"So let us not despair in our heartbreak.","wo":"Kon bunu bàyyi naqaru xol di tas sunu yaakaar yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKon bougnou bayi nakharou khol di tass sounou yakar yeupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3052,"row":{"en":"As the twentieth century drew to a close, computers and electronics were becoming increasingly intertwined.","wo":"Bi ñuy dugg ci ñaar fukkeelu xarnu bi, ordinatër yi ak aparey elektronik dañu tàmbali di leen boole.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnouy dougg thi niar foukeélou kharnou bi, ordinateur yi ak aparey electronik daniou tambali di léne boolé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3053,"row":{"en":"These are the ones that are so relatable or absurd that they make us laugh out loud.","wo":"Yenn ci ñoom yoon yiy wane mbir yu xawa wayadi yu kenn mënul baña ree ba tas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYen thi gnom yone yiy wané mbir you khawa wayadi you kene meunoul bagnia ré ba tass.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3054,"row":{"en":"She was also very smart and could learn tricks like sit, stay, and come.","wo":"Ku neexoon xel la lool, soo ko waxee toogal, bul dem, ñëwal dakoy xam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou nékhone khél la loool, soko wakhé togal boul dém, gneuwal dakoy kham.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3055,"row":{"en":"Compaoré ruled Burkina Faso for 27 years, during which time he reversed many of Sankara's reforms and established a repressive authoritarian regime.","wo":"Compaoré jiitena Burkina Faso diiru 27 at, ci nguuram dindi na coppite yu bari yu Thomas Sankhara amaloon, daal di indi xeetu nguur guy jaay doole askan wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCompaooré djiténa Burkina Faso diirou 27 ans, ci ngouram dindi na coppité you bari you Thomas Sankhara amaloon, daldi indi khétou ngour guy diay dolé askane wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3056,"row":{"en":"The materials used vary from soft broom corn silk to durable craft straw bound to a sturdy doll-sized handle.","wo":"Mbir yi ñu jëfandikoo ngi dalee ci ñaxu mboq ba si soi buy yàgg ngir defar jàppukaay bu tollu ni puppe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbire yi gnou dieufandiko ngui dalé thi niakhou mbokh ba si soie bou yague nguir defar diapoukay bou tollou ni poupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3057,"row":{"en":"The city was a vast, sprawling metropolis, full of life and energy.","wo":"Dëkk bu rëy la woon, bari ay xeet yu wuute, xumb te bari yëngu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeuk bou reuy la wone bari ay khéte you wouté khoumbe té bari yeungue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3058,"row":{"en":"The next part starts by calling the setup function in the helpers module.","wo":"Wàll wi ci topp mooy woo fonction tabb ci modulu ndimbal li.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWall wi thi top moy woo fonction tab thi moduleu ndimbal li.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3059,"row":{"en":"hobby","wo":"yëngu-yëngu bi nga sopp","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nyeungou yeungou bi nga sopé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3060,"row":{"en":"The main characteristics a stone should possess are uniform surface, grain, and density.","wo":"Yenn mbir yi xaar wara am mooy surface bu maase ay pepp ak dëgëraay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYenn mbir yi khar wara ame moy surface bou masse ay pepp ak deugueureuy.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3061,"row":{"en":"I thought about my family and friends, and how they would miss me.","wo":"Ma kalaat sama njaboot ak samay xarit, ak niñu ma nara nammee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa khalaate sama gniaboot ak samay kharite ak nignou ma nara namé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3062,"row":{"en":"The area was first settled by Bantu peoples around 3000 BC